(180, 'gaming_user_1762180162100_h7fxyijjn', 'gaming_user_1762180162100_h7fxyijjn', 'bot', 'Hello there! I\'d be absolutely thrilled to help you find the perfect gaming PC to enjoy CS:GO and League of Legends! Those are fantastic games, and having the right system makes all the difference.\n\nBased on your needs for a gaming PC around 20,000,000 VNĐ to play CS:GO and League of Legends, I have an excellent recommendation for you:\n\n*   **Gaming PC RTX 3060** at **18,000,000.00 VNĐ**\n\nThis PC is a superb choice for your budget and game preferences! It comes equipped with an **RTX 3060 graphics card**, an **AMD Ryzen 5 5600X processor**, 16GB of DDR4 RAM, and a spacious 1TB SSD. The RTX 3060 is more than capable of delivering smooth and high-frame-rate gameplay for both CS:GO and League of Legends, allowing you to enjoy those fast-paced titles without any hiccups. The Ryzen 5 5600X also provides strong performance, ensuring your games run efficiently.\n\nIt fits perfectly within your \"around 20 million VND\" budget, leaving you with some room for other gaming essentials if you wish!\n\nWhat do you think of this option? I\'m confident it will give you an amazing gaming experience for the games you love!', '{\"intent\":\"gemini_response\"}', NULL, '{\"quickReplies\":[\"I want to know detailed price\",\"What accessories are suitable?\",\"Compare with other products\",\"More consultation\"]}', '2025-11-03 14:31:16'),
