(254, 'gaming_user_1766049803810_pxlvzigbi', 'gaming_user_1766049803810_pxlvzigbi', 'bot', 'Great! I\'m happy to help you find the perfect gaming headset within your budget of under 5 million VNĐ!\n\nBased on your budget, here are a couple of excellent options from our selection:\n\n1.  **SteelSeries Arctis 7P: 3,500,000 VNĐ** - This wireless headset is designed for PlayStation but works great on PC too! It offers 7.1 surround sound, is Discord certified for clear communication, and has a 24-hour battery life.\n\n2.  **Razer BlackShark V2 Pro: 3,200,000 VNĐ** - Another fantastic wireless option, the BlackShark V2 Pro features THX Spatial Audio for immersive sound and a noise-canceling microphone, perfect for competitive gaming.\n\n3.  **Corsair HS80 RGB Wireless: 3,000,000 VNĐ** - This wireless headset not only offers great sound but also has customizable RGB lighting. The microphone is broadcast-quality, and the battery lasts for 20 hours.\n\n4.  **HyperX Cloud Alpha S: 2,800,000 VNĐ** - This headset offers 7.1 surround sound, a detachable microphone, and is compatible with multiple platforms, giving you great versatility.\n\nDo any of these sound particularly interesting to you? Let me know if you have any specific needs, like if you prefer wireless or have a preferred brand, and I can help narrow it down further!', '{\"intent\":\"gemini_response\"}', NULL, '{\"quickReplies\":[\"I want to know more\",\"Consult other products\",\"Thank you\",\"I have another question\"]}', '2025-12-18 09:24:00'),
