(256, 'gaming_user_1766049803810_pxlvzigbi', 'gaming_user_1766049803810_pxlvzigbi', 'bot', 'Okay! Based on the product list, here are my top recommendations for the best gaming headset, keeping in mind your preference for under 5 million VNĐ:\n\n1.  **SteelSeries Arctis 7P: 3,500,000 VNĐ** - If you\'re looking for a wireless option with great compatibility, the Arctis 7P is an excellent choice. It\'s designed for PlayStation but works perfectly with PC as well. The 7.1 surround sound will immerse you in your games, and the Discord certification ensures clear communication with your teammates. Plus, the 24-hour battery life means you can game for extended periods without needing to recharge!\n\n2.  **Razer BlackShark V2 Pro: 3,200,000 VNĐ** - Another fantastic wireless option, the BlackShark V2 Pro stands out with its THX Spatial Audio, providing a truly immersive sound experience. The noise-canceling microphone is a huge plus for competitive gaming, ensuring your voice comes through clearly.\n\n3.  **Corsair HS80 RGB Wireless: 3,000,000 VNĐ** - If you want a headset that looks as good as it sounds, the Corsair HS80 RGB Wireless is a great pick. The customizable RGB lighting adds a touch of flair, while the broadcast-quality microphone ensures crystal-clear communication. The 20-hour battery life is also quite impressive.\n\n4.  **HyperX Cloud Alpha S: 2,800,000 VNĐ** - For a versatile headset that works with multiple platforms, the HyperX Cloud Alpha S is an excellent choice. It offers 7.1 surround sound for immersive gaming, and the detachable microphone adds convenience.\n\nDo any of these options catch your eye? I\'m here to help if you have any more questions or need further clarification!', '{\"intent\":\"gemini_response\"}', NULL, '{\"quickReplies\":[\"I want to know more\",\"Consult other products\",\"Thank you\",\"I have another question\"]}', '2025-12-18 09:24:14'),
